      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.55,
      "end_seconds": 5.34,
      "duration_seconds": 4.79,
      "text": "Hello, come in. Mind the step. Right, where shall we begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 6.36,
      "end_seconds": 12.13,
      "duration_seconds": 5.77,
      "text": "It's mood swings. I thought I'd wait, but it hasn't gone."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 13.06,
      "end_seconds": 16.52,
      "duration_seconds": 3.46,
      "text": "When was the first time you noticed it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 17.67,
      "end_seconds": 19.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.27,
      "text": "Probably four weeks. Yeah."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 21.83,
      "end_seconds": 24.97,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "How strong would you say it is?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 26.03,
      "end_seconds": 29.54,
      "duration_seconds": 3.51,
      "text": "Pretty moderate, if I'm being honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 30.05,
      "end_seconds": 34.48,
      "duration_seconds": 4.43,
      "text": "I see, go ahead. What about your medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 35.77,
      "end_seconds": 39.56,
      "duration_seconds": 3.79,
      "text": "So, I have diabetes, for two years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 40.24,
      "end_seconds": 42.88,
      "duration_seconds": 2.64,
      "text": "Do you take any regular medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 44.57,
      "end_seconds": 49.01,
      "duration_seconds": 4.44,
      "text": "No, uh, I don't take any tablets."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 58.86,
      "end_seconds": 63.07,
      "duration_seconds": 4.21,
      "text": "Are there any allergies I should be aware of?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 64.16,
      "end_seconds": 66.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "Not to my knowledge, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 67.53,
      "end_seconds": 69.9,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "Now some background about your lifestyle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 72.0,
      "end_seconds": 91.13,
      "duration_seconds": 19.13,
      "text": "I smoke roughly a pack every two days. I used to drink heavily but I stopped four years ago. Yes, I work in a bakery, early starts. I live with my elderly mother. Not much, I mostly stay in these days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 109.19,
      "end_seconds": 111.22,
      "duration_seconds": 2.03,
      "text": "Anything surgical in your history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 112.06,
      "end_seconds": 128.23,
      "duration_seconds": 16.17,
      "text": "I had a meniscus repair on my knee four years ago. I kept putting it off, which I know isn't sensible. I just want to get back to normal, really."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 144.21,
      "end_seconds": 146.26,
      "duration_seconds": 2.05,
      "text": "Any sign of weight loss?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 146.96,
      "end_seconds": 150.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.32,
      "text": "No, I haven't had any weight loss."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 151.74,
      "end_seconds": 155.25,
      "duration_seconds": 3.51,
      "text": "Any very heavy bleeding or bleeding after sex?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 156.0,
      "end_seconds": 160.14,
      "duration_seconds": 4.14,
      "text": "No, um, none of those at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 160.7,
      "end_seconds": 164.26,
      "duration_seconds": 3.56,
      "text": "Anything on the skin I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 165.61,
      "end_seconds": 168.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "Nothing on the skin, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 169.67,
      "end_seconds": 172.82,
      "duration_seconds": 3.15,
      "text": "Any problems with your joints or muscles?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 173.35,
      "end_seconds": 175.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "I move fine otherwise."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 186.34,
      "end_seconds": 190.47,
      "duration_seconds": 4.13,
      "text": "Can I check a few measurements before we carry on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 200.35,
      "end_seconds": 202.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.48,
      "text": "Okay, this won't take long..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 217.89,
      "end_seconds": 225.16,
      "duration_seconds": 7.27,
      "text": "Okay: BP is 121 over 74, temperature 36.9, pulse is 75 beats a minute."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 227.19,
      "end_seconds": 228.58,
      "duration_seconds": 1.39,
      "text": "Is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 230.52,
      "end_seconds": 234.32,
      "duration_seconds": 3.8,
      "text": "Don't worry, we'll discuss it in a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 235.82,
      "end_seconds": 240.31,
      "duration_seconds": 4.49,
      "text": "I'd like to check you over now, if that's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 241.45,
      "end_seconds": 244.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "Take a deep breath for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 261.56,
      "end_seconds": 265.64,
      "duration_seconds": 4.08,
      "text": "Your blood pressure is normal and the abdomen is soft."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 270.6,
      "end_seconds": 276.17,
      "duration_seconds": 5.57,
      "text": "You can relax now. Okay, so my impression is this: It points towards perimenopause."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 276.93,
      "end_seconds": 279.22,
      "duration_seconds": 2.29,
      "text": "Is it dangerous, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 279.76,
      "end_seconds": 295.82,
      "duration_seconds": 16.06,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's perimenopause, and we'll watch how it goes. Regular exercise, light layers and avoiding triggers can help. Come back in three months. Have I covered everything you wanted?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 297.45,
      "end_seconds": 300.82,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "Ah, I think I understand everything. Thanks."
    }
  ]
}